    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Earlier actions in a narrative",
     "texto": [
      "When we tell past events (with Präteritum or Perfekt), we often need to clarify what had happened before. German uses the **Plusquamperfekt**: **hatte / war + Partizip II**.",
      "In the main clause, the conjugated auxiliary takes second position (**Ich hatte den Bericht bereits ausgedruckt, als der Chef kam**); in the subordinate clause it goes at the end (**...weil der Kollege den Plan schon vorbereitet hatte**)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
